[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "か、勝てた……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "D-did we win...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "レスナ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい、完全に撃破できました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, we've completely defeated it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "リーベ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さすがに強かったわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That was a tough one, even for me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "ヴァレリア"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、これで先に進めるわね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But now we can move forward!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "ヴァレリア"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000船に戻って……あ、その前に難破船を\n少し調べて行こうか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! Let's get back to the ship... Oh, but first, maybe we should check out that wreckage."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "レスナ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふう……こんなものかしら。\nこれ、全部持っていくの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew... I think that's everything. We're taking all of this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "ヴァレリア"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "人のものを取っちゃうのって\n少し気が引けるけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I feel a little bad taking other people's things..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "レスナ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここに置いてあっても、\nいずれ朽ちて海に沈んじまうだけだからな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If we leave it here, it'll just rot and sink into the sea eventually."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "ランツェ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それに、こいつはこの船の乗組員がここまで来た証だ。\nせめて、これだけでも持って行ってやろうぜ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Besides, this is proof that this ship's crew made it this far. The least we can do is bring it with us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "ランツェ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そうですね。\n決して無駄にはいたしません！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You're right. We won't let it go to waste!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "レスナ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "航海日誌も、読ませていただきます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll read through the logbook too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "レスナ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃ、さっさと積み込んで出発するぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All right, let's load up and get moving."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "ランツェ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "アルビーナ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ？\u3000どうかした？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina? What's wrong?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "レスナ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううん……なんでもないっす。\nちょっと疲れちゃって……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's nothing... I'm just a little tired..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "アルビーナ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "仕方ないわよ、あんな激しい戦いの後だもの。\nあー、ベッドでゆっくり休みたーい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Can't blame you after a fight like that. Ugh, I'd kill for a nice bed right about now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "ヴァレリア"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "皆さん、早く温かいお湯に入って\n身体を温めて――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone, let's get you into a hot bath as soon as we're back to warm up—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "ヤンネ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "逃げて！！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "RUN!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "ヤンネ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんな……嘘、でしょ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No way... This can't be..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "アルビーナ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まだ、あんなに……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There are so many more...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "レスナ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分析を終了。いずれもレプルガルムと同等か……\nそれ以上ですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Analysis complete. Each one is on par with Repulgarm... or stronger."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "リーベ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "無理だよ……あんなの……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We can't... There's no way we can..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "アルビーナ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……逃げよう！\u3000早く！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...We have to run! Now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "アルビーナ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……緊急避難用の炉に火を入れろ！\n撤退するぞ！\u3000バーバラ号も後に続け！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Fire up the emergency furnace! We're retreating! Barbara, follow our lead!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "ランツェ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "果ての大陸まで、あと少しなのに……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We were so close to World's End...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "ヴァレリア"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "命あっての物種だろうが！！\n全員生きて帰るのが最優先だ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not if we're dead! Our top priority is getting everyone back alive!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "ランツェ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（追いすがる魔物たちを振り切って\n\u3000船は暗黒の氷海から遠ざかっていく）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The ships pulled away from the Dark Frozen Sea, shaking off the pursuing monsters.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "レスナ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（果ての大陸は、どこまでも果てにある……\n\u3000近づいたからこそ、その遠さがよく分かって……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(World's End truly was at the end of the world... The closer we got, the clearer that became...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "レスナ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（私たちは暗黒の氷海の入口で\n\u3000門前払いを食ったのでした……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(We'd been turned away at the gates of the Dark Frozen Sea...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "レスナ"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]